    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>As a Magic action, you can speak this magical walking stick’s command word and drive it into the ground. It stands upright and projects a canopy of transparent force filling a 20-foot Cube that originates from the stick. The canopy lasts for 1 hour or until you dismiss it as a Magic action.</p><p>Creatures and objects inside the canopy are sheltered from ordinary weather such as rain or snow, and the air within stays comfortable and dry whatever the weather outside. Creatures, objects, and magical effects can still pass through the canopy as normal.</p><p>After the canopy disappears, the stick can’t be used again for 1d12 hours.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-lOAtK9IcCOJIzJ7b\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’activité <em>Raise Canopy</em> dépense l’utilisation du bâton et lance le 1d12 heures d’attente : rendez-lui son utilisation à la main une fois ce délai écoulé.</p></section>",
